==========
psion/4_series3 #2888, from hem, 298 chars, Sep 29 9:54 95
Comment to 2861.
----------
A call to the EPOC OS service GENMARKNONACTIVE (0x8b subset 0x13) will do 
this. To call from OPL use: call($138b,0,0,0,0,0)
This marks the process as non active (and therefore will not keep 
reseting the auto switch off). To mark a process as active again: 
call($128b,0,0,0,0,0)

ANDREW


